      ],
      "assessment": "Read all 84 lines. Explicit TensorViewPlaceholder is just an order field. Separate private CheckedTensorShape validates nonempty positive u64 extents and checked product, stores extents/volume and exposes dimension count and volume. This establishes only shape arithmetic on the stated restricted carrier; zero-dimensional/scalar empty shape and zero extents are intentionally excluded. No data buffer, strides, aliasing or zero-copy view is implemented. Two tests check2x3x4 and zero refusal."
    }
